2 CONT  Odoardo Farnese, Duca di Parma was born on 28 April 1612 at Parma, Italy. (2), (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Rainuzzio I Farnese, Duca di Parma and Margherita Aldobrandini. (1), (2) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Margherita de Medici, daughter of Cosimo II de Medici, Granduca di Toscana and Maria Magdalena Erzherzogin von Österreich, on 11 October 1628 at Florence, Italy. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 11 September 1646 at age 34 at Viacenza, Italy. (2), (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Odoardo Farnese, Duca di Parma succeeded to the title of Duca di Parma in 1622. (1)
