2 CONT
2 CONT HIS DESCENDANTS IN THE PALAWAN, PHILIPPINES UNTIL NOW:
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT THAT EVEN MANUEL PONCE DE LEON, THE 27TH GOVERNOR GENERAL OF THE PHILIPPINES, THE GRANDFATHER OF PABLO PONCE DE LEON WAS ERASED IN HISTORY BY ENEMIES OF THE PONCE DE LEON IN SPAIN BY OMITTING THE WORD PONCE. THUS CREATING A DIFFER
2 CONC ENT PERSON. JESUITS HISTORICAL ACCOUNTS CLEARLY IDENTIFIED HIM AS MANUEL PONCE DE LEON, THE GRANDFATHER OF PABLO. PABLO PONCE DE LEON WAS ALSO ERASED IN HISTORY BY THE INTEREST GROUPS WHO CLAIMED THE DUKEDOM OF ARCOS. BY NOT RECOG
2 CONC NIZING THE FIRST FAMILY OF DON ANTONIO'S SONS , PABLO AND RODRIGO. ONLY RECORDED IS THE LAST WIFE OF ANTONIO WHOM HE MARRIED WHEN HE AS 52 YEARS OLD. ANTONIO MARRIED FIRST AT HIS TEENAGE... WITH 2 SONS. IN THE SECOND WIFE PRODUCED
2 CONC  NO CHILDREN AT ALL DUE TO OLD AGE.
2 CONT
2 CONT PLEASE BE CLARIFIED THAT PABLO AND RODRIGO ARE VICTIMS OF INTEREST GROUPS WHO ASSUMED THE DUCHY WHILE THEY WERE EXILES.
2 CONT
2 CONT CLAIMING THE DUCHY BACK IS NOT THE ISSUE HERE BUT JUST THE CORRECT LINEAGE.
2 CONT
2 CONT THE ANTONIO PONCE DE LEON II WAS BORN IN CUYO, PHILIPPINES WHERE THE TOMB OF PABLO WAS STILL PRESENT AT THE VERY ALTAR OF THE CUYO SACRED CHURCH.
2 CONT
2 CONT THE FATHER OF ANTONIO II IS FELIPE PONCE DE LEON IN MEMORY OF FELIPE V DE BOURBON, KING OF SPAIN THEIR ANCESTOR :
