2 CONT <p><h1 id="firstHeading" class="firstHeading" lang="en">Juan Claros P&eacute;rez de Guzm&aacute;n, 11th Duke of Medina Sidonia</h1></p><p><div id="bodyContent" class="mw-body-content"></p><p><div id="siteSub">From Wikipedia, the f
2 CONC ree encyclopedia</div></p><p><div id="contentSub">&nbsp;</div></p><p><div id="jump-to-nav" class="mw-jump">Jump to: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Claros_P%C3%A9rez_de_Guzm%C3%A1n,_11th_Duke_of_Medina_Sidonia#mw-head"
2 CONC >navigation</a>, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Claros_P%C3%A9rez_de_Guzm%C3%A1n,_11th_Duke_of_Medina_Sidonia#p-search">search</a></div></p><p><div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-content-ltr" lang="en" dir="ltr"></p><
2 CONC p><p><strong>Juan Claros P&eacute;rez de Guzm&aacute;n y Fern&aacute;ndez de C&oacute;rdoba, 11th Duke of Medina Sidonia</strong> (1642 &ndash; 1713) became <a title="Duke of Medina Sidonia" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duk
2 CONC e_of_Medina_Sidonia">Duke of Medina Sidonia</a> in 1667 upon the death of his half-brother <a title="Gaspar Juan P&eacute;rez de Guzm&aacute;n, 10th Duke of Medina Sidonia" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaspar_Juan_P%C3%A9re
2 CONC z_de_Guzm%C3%A1n,_10th_Duke_of_Medina_Sidonia">Gaspar Juan P&eacute;rez de Guzm&aacute;n, 10th Duke of Medina Sidonia</a>.</p></p><p><p>In around 1670 he married <a class="new" title="Antonia Teresa Pimentel (page does not exist)"
2 CONC  href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Antonia_Teresa_Pimentel&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1">Antonia Teresa Pimentel</a> (b.1646). She was the daughter of the 8th Duke of Benavente and already twice widowed. Her first 
2 CONC husband <a class="new" title="Andrea Fabrizio Pigntelli d&acute;Aragona (page does not exist)" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Andrea_Fabrizio_Pigntelli_d%C2%B4Aragona&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1">Andrea Fabrizi
2 CONC o Pigntelli d&acute;Aragona</a>, Prince of the Holy Roman Empire, 5th Prince of Noia and 7th <a class="new" title="Duke of Monteleone (page does not exist)" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Duke_of_Monteleone&amp;a
2 CONC ction=edit&amp;redlink=1">Duke of Monteleone</a> was killed in battle in 1677. Her second was <a class="new" title="Jaime FrancicoV&iacute;ctor Fern&aacute;ndez de H&iacute;jar (page does not exist)" href="https://en.wikipedia.org
2 CONC /w/index.php?title=Jaime_Francico_V%C3%ADctor_Fern%C3%A1ndez_de_H%C3%ADjar&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1">Jaime Francico V&iacute;ctor Fern&aacute;ndez de H&iacute;jar</a>, 5th <a class="new" title="Duke of H&iacute;jar (page does
2 CONC  not exist)" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Duke_of_H%C3%ADjar&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1">Duke of H&iacute;jar</a>. He was <a title="Mayordomo mayor" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mayordomo_mayor">Mayor
2 CONC domo mayor</a> to King <a title="Charles II of Spain" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_II_of_Spain">Charles II</a> and later <a title="Caballerizo mayor" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caballerizo_mayor">Caballeriz
2 CONC o mayor</a> to King <a title="Philip V of Spain" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philip_V_of_Spain">Philip V</a>.</p></p><p><p>The duke also married for a second time to a <a class="new" title="Mariana N&uacute;&ntilde;ez Feli
2 CONC pez de Guzm&aacute;n (page does not exist)" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mariana_N%C3%BA%C3%B1ez_Felipez_de_Guzm%C3%A1n&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1">Mariana N&uacute;&ntilde;ez Felipez de Guzm&aacute;n</a> y 
2 CONC Velez, the 3rd Duchess of Medina de las Torres, whose father, Ramiro, had been <a class="mw-redirect" title="Viceroy of Naples" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viceroy_of_Naples">Viceroy of Naples</a>.</p></p><p><table class="
2 CONC wikitable succession-box" style="font-size: 95%; clear: both; margin: 0.5em auto;"></p><p><tbody></p><p><tr><th style="border-top: #ace777 5px solid;" colspan="3"><a title="Spanish nobility" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spa
2 CONC nish_nobility">Spanish nobility</a></th></tr></p><p><tr style="text-align: center;"></p><p><td style="width: 30%;">Preceded&nbsp;by<br /><span style="font-weight: bold;"><a title="Gaspar Juan P&eacute;rez de Guzm&aacute;n, 10th Du
2 CONC ke of Medina Sidonia" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaspar_Juan_P%C3%A9rez_de_Guzm%C3%A1n,_10th_Duke_of_Medina_Sidonia">Gaspar Juan P&eacute;rez de Guzm&aacute;n</a></span></td></p><p><td style="width: 40%; text-align: cente
