2 CONT Isabella Elizabeth Farnese was born on 25 October 1692 at Parma, Italy. She was the daughter of Odoardo II Farnese, Duca di Parma and Dorothea Sophie Pfalzgräfin von Neuburg. (3) She married Felipe V de Borbón, Rey de España, son 
2 CONC of Louis de Bourbon, Dauphin de France and Maria-Anna Prinzessin von Bayern, on 24 December 1714. She died on 11 July 1766 at age 73.
