1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When José Antonio De Lavalle y Zugasti was born about 1780, in Trujillo, La Libertad, Peru, his father, José Antonio de Lavalle Cortés, was 47 and his mother, Mariana Zugasti y Ortiz Foronda, was 33. He married Ana
2 CONC  María de los Dolores Sánchez Trujillo Barragán y García Velásquez in 1801, in Diócesis de Cádiz, Andalusia, Spain. They were the parents of at least 5 sons.
