1 NOTE Jose Alvarez de Toledo y Gonzaga was a lover of the arts.
2 CONT He was patron to the artist Goya who painted the portrait here next to his name herein.
2 CONT In his hand he holds a music score written by Joseph Hayden. Jose was also Haydn's patron as well as an accomplished musician. Goya also included Jose's love of the equestrian pursuits as can be seen within Jose riding boots and o
2 CONC utfit. The painter was an accomplished portrait artist.
2 CONT Jose Alvarez de Toledo was a 15th Duke of Medina Sidonia and the 11th Marquise of Villa Franca.
2 CONT Jose made a grave mistake in playing some court intrigue in trying to oust the queen's favorite Godoy.
2 CONT Life never was the same for him after that. He died in Madrid at the age of 40.
