2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Thérèse de France, fille de France, Madame Royale, (19 July 1746 – 27 April 1748[1]) was a French princess by birth. She was the second of her paternal grandparents' grandchildren after the birth of Princess Isabella of Parm
2 CONC a (1741-1763)[2].
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
2 CONT
