1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NICOLAS WAS AN EXILE IN CUYO, PALAWAN, PHILIPPINES IN 1808 IN FEAR OF THE FRENCH OCCUPATION OF SPAIN BY THE BONAPARTE'S BROTHERS.
2 CONT
2 CONT NICOLAS JOINED THE EXPEDITION OF EXILES TO CUYO IN 1808 TOGETHER WITH THE FAMILY OF DON PABLO PONCE DE LEON HIS COUSIN. ALSO THE SON OF THE MARQUIS DE USTARIZ II, NAMED PEDRO USTARIZ.... ABOUT 10 GALLEONS ARRIVED TO CUYO, PALAWAN,
2 CONC  PHILLIPINES IN 1808. THIS IS SIMILAR TO THE ESCAPE OF THE ROYAL FAMILY OF PORTUGAL TO BRAZIL AT THAT SAME YEAR. THE PONCE DE LEON'S ARE CLOSE RELATIVES OF THE PORTUGUESE ROYALTY.
