2 CONT * He '''married''' Maria de la Concepcion Belvís de Moncada, daughter of Pascual Benito Belvís Moncada and Ibáñez de Segovia, Marquis of Belgida II, XIII Marquis of Mondejar, etc..'''No descendants'''.
2 CONT * He '''married''' Maria Teresa de Silva y Palafox, daughter of Pedro de Alcantara Fernandez de Hijar Fadrique and comprises of Bolea, IX Duke of Aliaga, IX Duke of Hijar, IX Duke of Lécera, V Duke of Bournonville, etc.. Issue, fr
2 CONC om her second marriage, a daughter
