2 CONC rried''' to John Augustine Idiáquez and Carvajal, second son of Francisco de Borja de Idiaquez and Palafox, IV Duke of Granada de Ega etc. No descendants. He was succeeded by a grandson of Francisco Fausto Palafox and Rebolledo, e
