1 CONT Charles II of Great Britain. He concluded peace with Spain, improved
1 CONT Portugal's financial condition, and negotiated commercial treaty with England
1 CONT in 1703. In the last years of the 17th century, the goldfields of Brazil
1 CONT provided Peter with great wealth and enabled him to govern without seeking
1 CONT revenues from the Cortes after 1697. Peter died in the midst of war.
