0 @N6000000002322348139@ NOTE She was a niece of the Italian prince Francesco Farnese (1678-1727), duke of
1 CONT Parma. She used Spanish power to reduce Austrian influence in Italy, as well
1 CONT as being a big influence upon her husband during his rule. Philip had few
1 CONT intimate friends; his chief interests were religion, hunting, and music.
1 CONT During the last years of his reign he often lapsed into periods of insanity,
1 CONT and his wife largely controlled public affairs.
